# Platform Invariants (FE)

Next.js App Router, auth-first. External docs are read only through the
configured docs hub; never assume a sibling checkout.

## Layers

`src/app` / `src/components` → `src/hooks` → `src/services` + `src/stores` → `src/models` + `src/validations` → HTTP client

- No direct HTTP calls in route/component · no reverse import from `models/`
- Form: React Hook Form + schema in `validations/` + models · `platform-contract-naming.mdc`
- Feature order: models → service → store? → hook → validation? → route/component + testId
- **Gen first** (`portal:gen`); AI chỉ gap chưa có template/registry.

## UI · size · E2E · imports

- Tiers: `src/components/ui` → product components → route sections → `src/app/**/page.tsx`
- Registry: `registries/design.registry.json` · `platform-design-vocabulary.mdc`
- ~200 lines/file · `platform-code-size.mdc`
- Test IDs are stable product contracts consumed by Testkit E2E.
- Imports: configured `@/*` aliases — `platform-import-alias.mdc`
